a39e67410454380","event_uuid":"2b40372a-e32b-44b8-aed2-ed20efd55ca3","position":{"commit_sha":"4d82066124a0ec4042ad373b49f5ff720e26f42e","position":"1788323754945280001-2b40372a-e32b-44b8-aed2-ed20efd55ca3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e840433b014e697ae3beeba5140771b3aa92d5dab377671e5e6105804ba19f32","event_uuid":"1bc8a061-ca10-45cf-8858-309b67cde2af","position":{"commit_sha":"613cd19cb6ff8fed270231e7a8c614118f58c232","position":"1788324226526216001-1bc8a061-ca10-45cf-8858-309b67cde2af"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788314093335214001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml:68-184,397` invokes external actions in a workflow with contents/actions-write and OIDC capability. Existing actionlint covers all workflows, but `Makefile` does not require zizmor to inspect this credentialed workflow and the focused pin contract covers only release workflow behavior.\n\n## Approach\n\nReplace every non-relative/external `uses:` reference in `.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml`—including `actions/checkout`, `actions/setup-python`, and `actions/cache`, as well as third-party actions—with an exact 40-hex commit SHA followed by a readable version comment. Edit `Makefile` so `ZIZMOR_WORKFLOWS` unconditionally includes `.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml`. Extend `tests/unit/test_release_workflow_pins.py` (or its renamed focused successor) by reading each complete external `uses:` line, not its existing whitespace-truncated `uses:\\s*(\\S+)` token. Match the complete line against `uses:\\s*\\S+@([0-9a-f]{40})\\s+#\\s+[^\\n]+$`, thereby proving both the SHA and its trailing readable version comment.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml`\n- `Makefile` — add the workflow to `ZIZMOR_WORKFLOWS`.\n- `tests/unit/test_release_workflow_pins.py` — parse complete external `uses:` lines and enforce the full-SHA-plus-readable-version-comment contract.\n\n## Testing\n\nRun the focused pin test with three negative controls: a mutable tag, a bare SHA without a comment, and a SHA followed by a comment that the whitespace-token extractor would otherwise discard. Run the existing `make lint` actionlint/zizmor path and confirm zizmor receives the reconciliation workflow.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Every external `uses:` reference in `.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml`, including first-party `actions/*`, has an exact 40-hex SHA followed by a readable version comment.\n- [ ] `Makefile` unconditionally includes `.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml` in `ZIZMOR_WORKFLOWS`.\n- [ ] The focused pin test reads complete `uses:` lines and fails for a mutable tag, a bare SHA, and an unexamined trailing comment; it does not reuse a whitespace-truncated token to verify the comment.\n- [ ] The focused test and existing actionlint/zizmor checks pass with the pinned workflow.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml","reason":"replace mutable privileged action refs with full SHAs"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_release_workflow_pins.py","reason":"extend pin contract to reconciliation workflow"},{"path":"Makefile","reason":"include workflow in existing actionlint/zizmor/pin target if required"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","security","ci","rp33"],"ticket_id":"1c70-319a-2ded-43f9","ticket_type":"task","title":"SHA-pin all external actions in the privileged reconciliation workflow","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ff6709e6-f43c-45b3-b14c-979c46780345","696c5108-cfd5-44ae-b2f1-88d1043c1306","44d1c1e4-cd22-4378-a906-682f3571b108","2b40372a-e32b-44b8-aed2-ed20efd55ca3","1bc8a061-ca10-45cf-8858-309b67cde2af"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788328052179933001,"uuid":"27a7bd59-e73b-4806-86bd-d4eee95bb769"}